| !Boot for !Reel (a video player, from riscos-ffmpeg)
If "<Reel$Dir>"="" Then Set Reel$Dir <Obey$Dir>
| *Reel <a video, or a web address> plays it: for a command line, or another
| program handing it a stream (as for mplayer and ffplay)
SetMacro Alias$Reel /<Reel$Dir> %%*0
IconSprites <Obey$Dir>.!Sprites
| The file types a double-click opens with Reel even when it isn't loaded
| (ticked in File types on its icon bar menu)
IfThere Choices:Reel.Types Then Obey Choices:Reel.Types
